  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"通用接口，支持通用版商品库、升级版商品及小程序小游戏资产共享。共享模式支持旧版巨量引擎工作台下所有账户、及单账户共享，商品库和商品目前仅支持共享给ad投放账户。\",\"id\":\"tools.bp_asset_management.share\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/tools/bp_asset_management/share/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1834652218001420\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"tools.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"tools.return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"用于查看接口返回码和返回信息的具体含义\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1834652218001420\",\"title\":\"设置商品库\\u0026商品共享\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2EgQwkMx\"><strong>能力介绍</strong>：通用接口，支持通用版商品库、升级版商品及小程序小游戏资产共享。共享模式支持旧版巨量引擎工作台下所有账户、及单账户共享，商品库和商品目前仅支持共享给ad投放账户。</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201771938767757315%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-18X9CNc8\" id=\"h346b9f0-18X9CNc8\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-Vo0joskp\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/bp_asset_management/share/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/bp_asset_management/share/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1834652218001420\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-b3287fnG\" id=\"h346b9f0-b3287fnG\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-qjdssByT\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-1DoZHMS3\" id=\"h346b9f0-1DoZHMS3\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-W04H7EAp\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-byawZV3t\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-NhaURYh5\" id=\"h346b9f0-NhaURYh5\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">organization_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GAUh1hAJ\">巨量引擎旧版巨量引擎旧版巨量引擎工作台ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">instance_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OgYG0pwN\">资产ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rtkwpUsZ\">资产类型，可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-XHZK26kX\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2mA94WFI\"><code>DPA</code> 通用版商品库</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8RGjBk15\"><code>PRODUCT</code> 升级版商品</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">share_mode</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-C0JqaJeZ\">共享类型，可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-MdBg2TDI\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GJ0S4edA\"><code>旧版巨量引擎工作台_ALL_ACCOUNTS</code>共享给旧版巨量引擎工作台下所有巨量投放账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HXB6aa3c\"><code>PART</code>指定账户id共享</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">all_accounts_by_bp</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-O37JLEHz\">账户业务线，<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">当share_mode为</span><code>旧版巨量引擎工作台_ALL_ACCOUNTS</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">时条件必填，一次最多传一个值，可用枚举值：</span> </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-U7niLRO8\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-D48NqMrY\"><code>AD</code> 巨量投放账户</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_infos</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Y9oMKoMv\">指定id共享的账户列表，<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">当share_mode= </span><code>PART</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">时条件必填，一次共享最多支持100个账号信息</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-by1clstz\">账户类型 可选值:（商品库和商品指定id共享目前仅支持共享到巨量投放账户）</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-EJRIbnk2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-n9NsbpLh\"><code>AD</code>巨量投放账户</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EtFJxm4y\">账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">all_accounts_by_company</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WmV8NcAc\">主体共享信息</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-p69LT0go\">业务线 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-9AXCRSDX\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ol3SrdHX\"><code>AD</code> 营销</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">company_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section cla