<svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>json</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NFZgGQXm\">json返回值</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">error_list</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2RNFiRn9\">共享失败列表，列表为空则代表全部共享成功，若不为空，只会为以下两种情况中的一种，代表共享失败</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-8d00L50S\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LC1m9jqq\">若为指定账户共享失败，则account_info中的信息为共享失败的账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-iIXPSRNS\">若为bp下所有账户共享失败，则会返回all_accounts_by_bp</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">share_mode</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wcdOBEci\">共享类型 </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-DrSPQKmp\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-T2zbQEVD\"><code>旧版巨量引擎工作台_ALL_ACCOUNTS</code>共享给旧版巨量引擎工作台下所有巨量投放账户 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uWLbnWpn\"><code>PART</code>指定账户id共享 </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">error_message</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2g4LCSqj\">错误原因</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 36px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_info</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BTSOo17u\">账户列表，<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">共享类型为</span><code>PART</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">，共享失败账户读取account_infos；</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RlWfgknU\">失败账户类型</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-71WORXqi\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LUdPPUvL\"><code>AD</code> 营销</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-glvcL8f5\">具体失败账户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">all_accounts_by_bp</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nn9exZjF\">账户业务线，当入参共享模式为旧版巨量引擎工作台下账户共享时，共享失败会有此值返回：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-OdBPSM6m\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1tdAi7D9\"><code>AD</code> 营销</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">all_accounts_by_company</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5qQLSNEz\">主体信息</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PaNv37lJ\"> 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-pLADHcqL\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qkWviNDX\"><code>AD</code> 营销</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">company_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">request_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sjWroGDo\">请求日志id</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-CVVGNRT9\" id=\"h346b9f0-CVVGNRT9\">应答示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22HTTPS%2F1.1%20200%20OK%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22message%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22OK%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22code%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22data%5C%22%3A%20%7B%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qN2MP%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-KVH8so8X\"><br/></p></div>",
